@startuml
title F 审计功能结构分解
top to bottom direction
rectangle "F 审计模块" as F
rectangle "F1 成功审计\nappendInCurrentTransaction" as Success
rectangle "F2 安全事件\nrecordSecurityEvent" as Security
rectangle "F3 范围查询\nqueryAudit / getAuditDetail" as Query
rectangle "F4 详情投影\nAuditView / buildAuditDiff" as View
rectangle "白名单/ID规范化\nredactSnapshot" as Redact
rectangle "独立事务\nappendInNewTransaction" as NewTx
rectangle "上下文与权限\nAuditAccessPolicy" as Access
rectangle "日期和分页\nnormalizeQuery" as Params
database "iam_audit_log" as Audit
database "iam_login_log" as Login
F --> Success
F --> Security
F --> Query
F --> View
Success --> Redact
Success --> Audit : 调用方现有事务内INSERT
Security --> NewTx
NewTx --> Login : REQUIRES_NEW INSERT
Query --> Access
Query --> Params
Query --> Audit : 受范围约束的SELECT
View --> Redact
note bottom of F
结构化用例负责顺序与副作用
对象负责不变量与端口职责
纯函数负责确定性转换
end note
@enduml
